# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
build/
dist/

# Data cubes, images, and other large/binary scientific data formats --
# never committed. This project does not want observational or simulated
# data (Eos WNM/cold-gas column-density maps, synthetic cascade/fBm test
# fields, or any other cube/image) inside git history, regardless of size.
*.mat
*.npy
*.npz
*.fits
*.fit
*.h5
*.hdf5

# MATLAB toolbox / binary artifacts, in case a copy of MULTIFRACS or a
# similar toolbox ever ends up inside this tree (none currently does --
# the real MULTIFRACS toolbox lives in a separate, sibling project
# directory and was never copied in here; this is a defensive rule).
*.mex*
*.fig
/multifracs/
/MF_BS_tool*/

# handoff/plbmf_crosscheck/ cross-check artifacts: the two input fields
# (cascade_input.mat, fbm2d_input.mat) are already excluded by the *.mat
# rule above. The historical, JSON-only investigation artifacts below are
# excluded too -- not loaded by any test, kept out of the first commit to
# keep it minimal (see mfleaders_reference_output*.json,
# mfleaders_cascade_*.json, multifracs_crosscheck_output.json).
# multifracs_perscale_output.json and SPEC.md are NOT excluded: a test
# loads the former, and the latter documents the cross-check configuration.
handoff/plbmf_crosscheck/mfleaders_reference_output.json
handoff/plbmf_crosscheck/mfleaders_reference_output_unweighted.json
handoff/plbmf_crosscheck/mfleaders_reference_output_matchedfit.json
handoff/plbmf_crosscheck/mfleaders_cascade_perscale.json
handoff/plbmf_crosscheck/mfleaders_cascade_borderdiscard.json
handoff/plbmf_crosscheck/multifracs_crosscheck_output.json
